.TH "GENI\-UPLOADER\-GUIDMAP" "1" "October 2026" "geni-uploader 1.0.0" "Geni Uploader Manual"
.SH NAME
geni\-uploader\-guidmap \- probe manifest profile numbers against served IDs (verdicts only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geni\-uploader guidmap
.BI "\-\-manifest " "MANIFEST"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bounded read\-only diagnostic: compares each manifest target's profile number against served id and guid values in memory and prints a per\-target result (matched via id/guid with a shape\-only follow\-up GET, AMBIGUOUS, or UNRESOLVED after scanning). Identifiers are never printed. See docs/guid\-resolution.md for the resolution mechanism.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-\-token\-file " "TOKEN_FILE"
file outside the repo holding the access token (global, before the command)
.TP
.BI "\-\-manifest " "MANIFEST"
path to the upload manifest file (required)
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show a short summary and the option list, then exit.
